WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.208
Armor...

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:06.666
You're an adventurer now, Fran.

00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:09.916
You'll need some good defensive equipment.

00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:25.500
Amazing! There are so many things
I've never seen before.

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:34.832
Apparently, Alessa is currently home
to a highly skilled blacksmith.

00:00:35.957 --> 00:00:39.542
Come visit my store
if you need Armor, little girl.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.582
Who are you?

00:00:41.582 --> 00:00:43.125
Appraisal!

00:00:43.289 --> 00:00:45.582
(Name: Garrus, Species: Dwarf)
What's wrong with this old man?

00:00:45.582 --> 00:00:46.667
(Extra Skill: Godsight,
Title: Wandering Blacksmith)
His skills

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:47.917
(Honorary Blacksmith of Granzell)
and titles are incredible.

00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:51.792
Honorary Blacksmith of Granzell?

00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:54.375
So you can use Appraisal, little girl?

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:57.250
Could this old man be the legendary blacksmith?

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.250
How about it? Want to check out my store?

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.125
Teacher, what should we do?

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:04.667
Let's go with him but keep our guard up.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:06.500
Okay. I'll go.

00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:09.500
Follow me then.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.250
Is Mr. Garrus going
to sell his items to that girl?

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.707
That's such a waste!

00:01:17.707 --> 00:01:18.957
That's right.

00:01:18.957 --> 00:01:20.207
Pay them no mind.

00:01:20.207 --> 00:01:23.875
They're just scoundrels
who want to resell my stuff.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:27.042
There's no way I would sell to them.

00:01:27.042 --> 00:01:29.207
But you'll sell them to me?

00:01:29.207 --> 00:01:33.582
I happened to come across your battle
at the Adventurer's Guild.

00:01:33.582 --> 00:01:38.000
I would gladly sell my wares
to someone of your abilities.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.042
I only sell my stuff to adventurers
that I deem worthy.

00:01:43.042 --> 00:01:45.000
You passed the test.

00:01:51.417 --> 00:01:52.875
It fits me perfectly.

00:01:52.875 --> 00:01:55.250
It suits you well, Fran.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.375
Thank you.

00:01:56.375 --> 00:01:58.667
What do you think? They're the real deal.

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:00.500
(Flame Oxhorn Dress Armor)
These items have excellent stats.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.375
(Mithril Earring for Cat Beastkin)
Fire, physical,

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:03.792
(Paraclaw Cat Gauntlet)
paralysis, magic...

00:02:03.792 --> 00:02:06.332
(Poison Wyvern Boots)
They have resistance against all of those.

00:02:06.332 --> 00:02:08.625
I can let you have
all of those for 150,000 gold.

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:12.000
Is that really all right?
Such high-quality gear...

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.417
These items were commissioned by someone
who failed to return from the dungeon.

00:02:16.417 --> 00:02:18.167
Dungeon?

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:20.042
That's great, Fran!

00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:25.542
I got my first set of armor!

00:02:27.832 --> 00:02:30.207
They're not only strong but cute too!

00:02:30.207 --> 00:02:31.875
But then again...

00:02:32.625 --> 00:02:33.789
Everything here is more powerful than me...

00:02:33.789 --> 00:02:35.490
(ATK: 450)
Everything here is more powerful than me...

00:02:40.082 --> 00:02:41.375
You're right.

00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:42.207
All right.

00:02:42.207 --> 00:02:45.957
Let's have him show us his swords
for research purposes.

00:02:45.957 --> 00:02:47.457
Please let us have a look
at your swords.

00:02:47.457 --> 00:02:48.582
Huh?

00:02:48.582 --> 00:02:51.582
You already have a fine sword, don't you?

00:02:51.582 --> 00:02:54.750
It's my first time seeing one of those.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.792
That's an intelligence weapon, isn't it?

00:03:00.707 --> 00:03:04.207
How does he know about me?

00:03:09.957 --> 00:03:16.332
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:36.750
(Episode 3 The Arcane Blacksmith Is Suspicious)

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.541
(Episode 3 The Arcane Blacksmith Is Suspicious)
Appraisal?

00:04:38.541 --> 00:04:42.000
But I have the ability to block Appraisal.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.208
Even the guild master wasn't able to read us.

00:04:44.208 --> 00:04:46.541
How do you know that?

00:04:48.916 --> 00:04:52.500
My eyes are special, you see.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.500
I have Godsight.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.708
So it's due to his extra skill.

00:04:56.708 --> 00:05:00.416
Even if you can block Appraisal,
you won't fool me.

00:05:00.416 --> 00:05:03.333
Especially when it comes to weapons.

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:06.375
It's not a sword that can be compared
with the ones over there.

00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:08.541
This one's quite a powerful sword.

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:09.500
You lie!

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.416
There are plenty of weapons stronger than me!

00:05:11.416 --> 00:05:13.166
Teacher!

00:05:13.166 --> 00:05:14.541
It just spoke, didn't it?

00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:16.208
Was that telepathy?

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:17.250
Oh, crap!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:21.208
Don't worry. I'm just curious as a blacksmith.

00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:23.583
I'm sure Garrus isn't a bad guy.

00:05:23.583 --> 00:05:24.791
You think so?

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:26.083
Well, I guess he is not.

00:05:26.083 --> 00:05:27.458
Thank you.

00:05:27.458 --> 00:05:32.625
Considering your stats,
you don't need another sword from me.

00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:35.708
But your swords are more powerful.

00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:37.250
Like that one over there, for instance.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.875
If we're just talking
about ATK, then yes.

00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:40.833
I see.

00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:44.250
You don't know much
about mana conductivity, do you?

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.500
Mana conductivity?

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:49.666
(Teacher, Conductivity: A)
Now that you mentioned it,

00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:51.166
I think I did notice something
when my Appraisal leveled up...

00:05:51.166 --> 00:05:55.125
As the saying goes,
one eyewitness is better than ten hearsays.

00:05:55.125 --> 00:05:56.916
Unsheathe your sword.

00:05:57.916 --> 00:05:59.583
What do you want to do?

00:05:59.583 --> 00:06:03.166
This sword has an attack stat of 450.

00:06:03.166 --> 00:06:06.250
Imbue 100 mana into the sword and wield it.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.458
Huh? Okay.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.666
Here I go.

00:06:12.041 --> 00:06:15.291
Eh? S... Seriously?

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:17.625
Teacher, you're super sharp!

00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:20.083
Your mana conductivity is A.

00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:22.125
That means 200% conductivity.

00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:23.708
With 100 mana,

00:06:23.708 --> 00:06:26.375
your attack stat can be boosted by 200.

00:06:26.375 --> 00:06:29.750
T... that means...

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.250
My attack is actually 592!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.833
According to my estimation,

00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:37.458
you'll be fine
even if she imbues 1000 mana into you.

00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:40.625
Really? If I have more than 1000 mana,

00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:43.000
does that mean my attack stat will exceed 2000?

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.416
There is no doubt
that you are a powerful magic weapon.

00:06:46.416 --> 00:06:47.250
Really?

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:49.583
You're a nice guy, old man!

00:06:49.583 --> 00:06:53.250
Don't worry, Fran.
It looks like I am powerful, after all.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.208
I said so from the start, didn't I?

00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:57.166
Teacher is an amazing and powerful sword.

00:06:57.916 --> 00:06:59.333
Fran!

00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:00.875
Teacher!

00:07:03.041 --> 00:07:08.250
But I do wonder who created you?
And what is your name?

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:12.166
This is Teacher!
He is the most powerful sword of all!

00:07:12.166 --> 00:07:14.750
I'm afraid I have no recollection
of those things at all.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.750
Are you able to tell anything
with your Godsight, Sir?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:22.375
Creating a self-conscious sword is
beyond my skill of magic sword forging.

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:25.416
You must've been forged by a Divine Blacksmith.

00:07:25.416 --> 00:07:28.125
Divine Blacksmith?

00:07:28.125 --> 00:07:30.708
They are legendary blacksmiths
who are capable of creating

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:35.541
extraordinary weapons that are able
to tear the skies and lands apart.

00:07:35.541 --> 00:07:38.416
There were only five confirmed in history.

00:07:38.416 --> 00:07:41.250
Does that mean I am by any chance
a legendary sword?

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:44.125
You're lacking a little caliber
to be considered a legendary weapon...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.083
The legendary sword
I was fortunate enough to have laid eyes on...

00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:50.333
(Ignis, Sword of Flames)
was the sword of flames, Ignis.

00:07:51.708 --> 00:07:52.833
Terribly sorry.

00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:55.500
I'm no match for a true legendary sword.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.541
I'm afraid that's all I know.

00:07:58.541 --> 00:08:01.833
Not at all. You've been very helpful. Thank you.

00:08:01.833 --> 00:08:04.041
So, you guys still want another sword?

00:08:04.041 --> 00:08:05.583
No. I guess I myself suffice.

00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:08.208
But could we ask you to make me

00:08:08.208 --> 00:08:09.166
a scabbard?

00:08:09.166 --> 00:08:12.708
No problem.
I'll make you the best scabbard there is!

00:08:12.708 --> 00:08:14.333
This is heavy...

00:08:14.333 --> 00:08:17.458
Oh, right. Would you be able
to find some use for these?

00:08:20.666 --> 00:08:24.958
These are materials
from D-rank and C-rank monsters!

00:08:24.958 --> 00:08:28.208
I'll be able to make much stronger
armors with these.

00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:29.500
Really?

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.625
Oh, but we might not have enough money...

00:08:31.625 --> 00:08:33.707
How about paying me
with the remaining materials?

00:08:33.707 --> 00:08:35.457
Is that all right?

00:08:35.457 --> 00:08:38.667
Oh, rest assured, I won't make a loss.

00:08:38.667 --> 00:08:39.500
But...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.167
I can make great protective gear with these.

00:08:43.167 --> 00:08:47.125
High-quality goods that low-rank adventurers
won't be able to afford.

00:08:47.125 --> 00:08:49.207
I'll order any other materials I need and...

00:08:49.207 --> 00:08:51.207
Um, Sir...

00:08:51.207 --> 00:08:53.667
Oh, sorry.
I haven't felt so fired up in a while.

00:08:53.667 --> 00:08:56.832
It looks like
you two will depart on a grand adventure.

00:08:56.832 --> 00:09:00.500
So I thought
I should put good effort into those items.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.875
That would be wonderful!

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:03.500
Thank you, Garrus.

00:09:04.667 --> 00:09:06.375
This is great, Fran.

00:09:06.375 --> 00:09:08.417
I can have the scabbard ready in three days.

00:09:08.417 --> 00:09:11.167
Give me a month
for your better equipment, little girl.

00:09:11.167 --> 00:09:13.457
Okay. Looking forward to them.

00:09:15.832 --> 00:09:18.417
That's one thing settled. Now, Fran,

00:09:18.417 --> 00:09:22.542
would you need some undergarments perchance?

00:09:22.542 --> 00:09:24.917
Undergarments?
I can fight just fine without those.

00:09:24.917 --> 00:09:26.582
Absolutely not!

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:30.957
That is unsightly
of an adorable girl such as you!

00:09:30.957 --> 00:09:33.792
Follow me! I'll see that you get some.

00:09:36.832 --> 00:09:41.292
For a fair-skinned, dark-haired,
dark-eyed, and dark-eared beauty like you,

00:09:42.167 --> 00:09:43.917
black underwear will suit you perfectly!

00:09:43.917 --> 00:09:45.707
Black!

00:09:45.707 --> 00:09:48.167
We also have this and this...

00:09:48.167 --> 00:09:51.000
Oh, this might be a little mature...

00:09:53.542 --> 00:09:55.792
We have lots of other clothes too.

00:09:55.792 --> 00:09:57.292
Feel free to take a look around.

00:09:58.417 --> 00:10:01.750
Well, it can't hurt to look around
since you're already here.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:05.250
You're so cute, Fran!
You look amazing in everything!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.832
That's right! Fran is a natural beauty!

00:10:09.832 --> 00:10:12.167
Come again, Fran!

00:10:13.082 --> 00:10:14.917
Thank you.

00:10:14.917 --> 00:10:18.500
The lady from the clothing store
did us a great favour

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.167
by helping Fran find everything she needed.

00:10:20.167 --> 00:10:25.625
Now, we'll need some cooking equipment
and spices for our trip.

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:29.000
That's a top priority.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.292
Is this the place
the lady from the clothing store

00:10:32.292 --> 00:10:33.750
mentioned?

00:10:38.957 --> 00:10:42.332
Welcome to Saber-Tooth.

00:10:44.792 --> 00:10:45.875
He's huge!

00:10:45.875 --> 00:10:47.750
Is this a general store?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.207
Yes. We're often mistaken for a weapon shop,

00:10:51.207 --> 00:10:53.750
but this is a general store, without a doubt.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.542
He doesn't seem too reliable...

00:10:55.542 --> 00:10:57.082
Appraisal!

00:10:57.082 --> 00:10:58.750
(Name: Rufus, Class: Merchant)

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:00.957
(STR: 150)
A general store owner with 150 STR?

00:11:00.957 --> 00:11:03.500
He is basically an intermediate adventurer!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.582
Are you an adventurer?

00:11:05.582 --> 00:11:06.750
I used to be.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.167
I retired three years ago and opened this place.

00:11:10.167 --> 00:11:12.542
From your appearance, you must be a Black Cat.

00:11:12.542 --> 00:11:14.125
Are you an adventurer too?

00:11:14.125 --> 00:11:15.832
Yes.

00:11:15.832 --> 00:11:17.832
I see.

00:11:17.832 --> 00:11:20.000
Well, feel free to take a look around.

00:11:24.375 --> 00:11:26.332
They have a huge variety of spices!

00:11:26.332 --> 00:11:29.042
A nice collection of tableware too.

00:11:29.625 --> 00:11:31.375
Come again!

00:11:34.457 --> 00:11:38.125
With these,
I'll be able to prepare you some decent food.

00:11:38.125 --> 00:11:39.042
Really?

00:11:39.042 --> 00:11:42.292
I want to eat your cooking! Right now!

00:11:42.292 --> 00:11:43.957
All right, all right...

00:11:43.957 --> 00:11:46.207
Let's find an inn to stay in first.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.042
The guild card appears to work
as an identity card as well.

00:11:53.042 --> 00:11:56.332
As long as you have one,
even a child can stay in an inn all by herself.

00:11:56.332 --> 00:11:58.457
Being an adventurer comes with a lot of perks!

00:12:01.167 --> 00:12:04.082
This room looks alright.

00:12:04.082 --> 00:12:06.292
Teacher, this is our room, right?

00:12:06.292 --> 00:12:08.750
Yes. Is something the matter?

00:12:10.582 --> 00:12:12.082
It's an amazing room!

00:12:12.082 --> 00:12:14.957
Well, no...
It's not that great... It's pretty normal...

00:12:17.167 --> 00:12:20.082
I've never been
in such a comfortable room before...

00:12:20.082 --> 00:12:21.750
Feels like I'm dreaming...

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:22.917
Fran...

00:12:24.332 --> 00:12:27.667
It has been one surprise after another
since meeting you...

00:12:27.667 --> 00:12:29.582
This is all thanks to you, Teacher.

00:12:32.542 --> 00:12:33.582
Fran...

00:12:34.792 --> 00:12:36.582
Is that so?

00:12:36.582 --> 00:12:40.667
From now on, you'll get to stay in rooms
like this as much as you want.

00:12:40.667 --> 00:12:41.667
Really?

00:12:41.667 --> 00:12:44.625
Yes. You won't have to worry about food either.

00:12:44.625 --> 00:12:45.625
Yay!

00:12:45.625 --> 00:12:48.332
- I can't wait to taste Teacher's cooking!
- I must have...

00:12:48.332 --> 00:12:51.957
I will protect you and look after you
until the day you evolve.

00:12:51.957 --> 00:12:53.332
That's a promise.

00:12:54.207 --> 00:12:55.500
It's a promise.

00:12:56.375 --> 00:13:01.000
I must have come to this world for Fran.

00:13:03.875 --> 00:13:06.667
All right. Time to make dinner.

00:13:07.792 --> 00:13:09.125
Teacher's cooking!

00:13:09.125 --> 00:13:10.207
What would you like to eat?

00:13:10.207 --> 00:13:11.167
Meat!

00:13:11.167 --> 00:13:13.250
All right. We have all the spices too.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.667
Let's give it a whirl.

00:13:20.832 --> 00:13:22.667
Exciting!

00:13:22.667 --> 00:13:25.832
My special fried chicken
made with spices from another world!

00:13:28.707 --> 00:13:29.750
How is the taste?

00:13:30.667 --> 00:13:34.167
What is this? Magic? It's super tasty!

00:13:34.167 --> 00:13:36.207
Really? I'm glad you like it.

00:13:36.207 --> 00:13:38.957
You can make lots of delicious dishes
as long as you have spices, after all.

00:13:38.957 --> 00:13:40.917
The spices are amazing!

00:13:40.917 --> 00:13:44.292
With all these spices,
I might even be able to make curry.

00:13:45.792 --> 00:13:47.750
I feel so blessed and satisfied...

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:50.250
Thank you for the food, Teacher...

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:53.500
Okay. Your belly is full now.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.707
Tomorrow, we'll start taking on quests.

00:13:56.707 --> 00:13:58.917
Let's have a strategy meeting
on becoming stronger!

00:14:02.457 --> 00:14:06.625
Let's decide
how we'll be using my evo points in the future.

00:14:06.625 --> 00:14:08.167
Recovery magic.

00:14:08.167 --> 00:14:09.667
That's what I thought too.

00:14:09.667 --> 00:14:12.542
Donadrond's instant heal

00:14:12.542 --> 00:14:16.625
during battle was amazing.

00:14:16.625 --> 00:14:17.875
I agree.

00:14:17.875 --> 00:14:19.417
With our current level and equipment,

00:14:19.417 --> 00:14:22.125
we'll need such recovery skills to take on
higher leveled characters and monsters.

00:14:22.125 --> 00:14:24.332
I considered Doppelganger too,

00:14:24.332 --> 00:14:27.792
but let's max out recovery magic first.

00:14:27.792 --> 00:14:30.792
You'll be able to use it through skill sharing.

00:14:30.792 --> 00:14:31.417
Oh,

00:14:31.417 --> 00:14:35.167
we need to increase Sword Art
and Sword Technique too.

00:14:35.167 --> 00:14:37.957
But that'll use up a lot of points.

00:14:37.957 --> 00:14:39.875
Fran, do you have any other...

00:14:42.375 --> 00:14:47.792
I want to become stronger with Teacher...

00:14:49.667 --> 00:14:51.750
Oh, dear, she's even drooling in her sleep...

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.375
Well, I suppose it can't be helped.

00:14:54.375 --> 00:14:57.500
You've worked very hard today as well.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.957
Sweet dreams, Fran.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:17.792
REINCARNATED AS A SWORD

00:15:18.332 --> 00:15:21.332
This is a potion ingredient, Heal Grass.

00:15:24.332 --> 00:15:27.125
I believe this berry has antidotal properties.

00:15:28.375 --> 00:15:30.957
Quests for G-rank adventurers
are rather limited,

00:15:30.957 --> 00:15:33.792
mostly consisting of mundane tasks
such as gathering herbs.

00:15:33.792 --> 00:15:38.667
The only monster-related quests
would be subjugating level 3 goblins.

00:15:38.667 --> 00:15:42.207
These are Stamina Shrooms.
Use them in dishes to recover stamina.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:48.000
Thanks to our foraging, herbology,
and culinary skills, these jobs are a breeze.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.792
Fran, you must be happy learning all of this.

00:15:53.207 --> 00:15:55.332
That's not the face of someone who enjoys this!

00:15:57.957 --> 00:15:59.792
Well, we can't do much for now.

00:15:59.792 --> 00:16:02.667
This is part of an adventurer's job too.

00:16:04.832 --> 00:16:07.082
Sounds like a battle.

00:16:07.082 --> 00:16:08.292
I'll check it out.

00:16:08.292 --> 00:16:09.875
Let's go!

00:16:12.417 --> 00:16:15.292
Lily, Crull,
forget about me and get out of here.

00:16:15.292 --> 00:16:17.250
Don't give up, Eustace!

00:16:21.667 --> 00:16:24.125
Why are there so many of them?

00:16:24.125 --> 00:16:25.582
There were only supposed to be three!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.917
If only I didn't make us go deeper...

00:16:29.917 --> 00:16:30.957
Goblins.

00:16:30.957 --> 00:16:34.000
13 of them. That's quite a number.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:38.332
There are even Hobgoblins.

00:16:38.332 --> 00:16:40.457
The odds don't seem to be in their favor...

00:16:40.457 --> 00:16:41.875
I'll help them.

00:16:43.625 --> 00:16:46.875
Even at cost of my life,
I won't let you monsters get away...

00:16:46.875 --> 00:16:49.500
Take this! This is everything I've got!

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.332
- Fire...
- Fire Arrow!

00:16:52.375 --> 00:16:53.375
Huh?

00:16:53.375 --> 00:16:55.292
That was amazing, Eustace!

00:16:55.292 --> 00:16:58.000
Um, no, that wasn't me...

00:17:01.125 --> 00:17:02.875
A kid?

00:17:02.875 --> 00:17:05.666
Ten left. Let's do this, Fran!

00:17:05.666 --> 00:17:07.541
Teacher... It's burning.

00:17:07.541 --> 00:17:09.125
Get fired up!

00:17:09.125 --> 00:17:11.875
This is your first battle as an adventurer!

00:17:11.875 --> 00:17:14.250
No, the forest is on fire.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.875
Aqua Create!

00:17:17.375 --> 00:17:19.375
We can't use fire magic in a forest.

00:17:19.375 --> 00:17:21.875
Fran, use earth magic instead.

00:17:21.875 --> 00:17:23.500
Remember what we practiced, Fran?

00:17:24.208 --> 00:17:25.416
I'll try.

00:17:26.875 --> 00:17:29.000
- Stone Barrett!
- Stone Arrow!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.875
Your magic is amazing, Teacher!

00:17:35.875 --> 00:17:39.083
I can boost the power of my magic
with relevant skills.

00:17:39.083 --> 00:17:42.041
It's a shame I can't share them with you.

00:17:42.041 --> 00:17:44.125
Seven left.

00:17:44.125 --> 00:17:46.125
Double Slash!

00:17:46.125 --> 00:17:47.791
Who is that girl?

00:17:47.791 --> 00:17:49.375
She's so strong!

00:17:50.291 --> 00:17:52.333
Stone Barrett!

00:17:52.333 --> 00:17:54.750
Fran has leveled up to Level 4.

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.583
Oh, it's the PA! Haven't heard her in a while.

00:17:57.583 --> 00:18:00.208
I feel I got a bit stronger.

00:18:00.208 --> 00:18:02.041
Stone Barrett!

00:18:04.875 --> 00:18:07.000
Heavy Slash!

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:14.333
She took care of all of them on her own.

00:18:14.333 --> 00:18:15.791
Amazing...

00:18:19.166 --> 00:18:21.291
Circle Heal.

00:18:25.791 --> 00:18:28.250
This is Level 7 Intermediary Magic!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.083
This is my first time using recovery magic.

00:18:31.083 --> 00:18:33.416
It came in handy right away.

00:18:33.416 --> 00:18:35.666
Thank you! You saved us!

00:18:35.666 --> 00:18:37.083
You're amazing!

00:18:37.083 --> 00:18:38.750
Who are you?

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:41.125
Fran, a G-rank adventurer.

00:18:41.125 --> 00:18:41.791
G?

00:18:41.791 --> 00:18:44.250
The same rank as us?

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.708
Goodbye then.

00:18:45.708 --> 00:18:47.041
Wait!

00:18:47.041 --> 00:18:51.166
You should take the loot from the goblins.

00:18:51.166 --> 00:18:52.083
What should we do?

00:18:52.083 --> 00:18:54.833
Let's just take the loot from the Hobgoblins.

00:18:54.833 --> 00:18:58.125
I'll just loot the Hobgoblins.

00:18:58.125 --> 00:18:59.750
Hobgoblin?

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.583
Now that I look at them,

00:19:01.583 --> 00:19:03.625
these are all goblins of a higher rank...

00:19:03.625 --> 00:19:04.750
This is bad.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.541
Isn't this an omen of a goblin stampede?

00:19:07.541 --> 00:19:09.500
Goblin stampede?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.916
What's that?

00:19:11.541 --> 00:19:13.208
You don't know?

00:19:13.208 --> 00:19:15.916
When a lot of high-level goblins appear,

00:19:15.916 --> 00:19:19.416
there's a high chance
that the Goblin King is around.

00:19:19.416 --> 00:19:22.041
An army of goblins led by a king
has a threat level of D.

00:19:22.041 --> 00:19:25.333
The higher its leadership, the more goblins
will evolve into high-level goblins.

00:19:25.333 --> 00:19:28.708
When the Goblin Queen is born,

00:19:28.708 --> 00:19:32.875
all offspring produced
by the king and queen will be Hobgoblins.

00:19:32.875 --> 00:19:36.583
Their growth rate is alarmingly fast.
They'll create a horde in no time

00:19:36.583 --> 00:19:38.666
and will raise the threat level to C.

00:19:38.666 --> 00:19:42.000
They will invade human territories for food.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.958
That's what we call a goblin stampede.

00:19:43.958 --> 00:19:46.000
At that point,
they can even devastate large cities.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.750
Given the situation here...

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.333
Even Alessa will be in danger.

00:19:50.333 --> 00:19:53.041
We have to report this to the guild immediately.

00:19:53.041 --> 00:19:54.250
What about you?

00:19:55.041 --> 00:19:56.875
I...

00:19:58.916 --> 00:20:00.416
There were more?

00:20:00.416 --> 00:20:02.833
It called for backup!

00:20:02.833 --> 00:20:03.875
Go.

00:20:03.875 --> 00:20:05.458
But you...

00:20:07.666 --> 00:20:10.833
I want to give it a try here.

00:20:10.833 --> 00:20:13.125
Fran, are you sure you can handle this?

00:20:13.125 --> 00:20:14.166
I want to train myself more.

00:20:14.166 --> 00:20:17.333
Getting to take on a bunch of them
is just what I wanted.

00:20:17.333 --> 00:20:20.750
And if there's a den, we have to destroy it.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:24.000
All right. As they say, no pain, no gain.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.416
They're coming.

00:20:26.166 --> 00:20:27.375
I will break through!

00:20:39.166 --> 00:20:40.666
Are you all right, Fran?

00:20:40.666 --> 00:20:42.875
Yes, thanks to Garrus' Armor.

00:20:42.875 --> 00:20:45.416
Okay. The next one is coming from the front!

00:20:46.791 --> 00:20:49.416
Fran has leveled to Level 6.

00:20:49.416 --> 00:20:50.416
Not enough...

00:20:50.416 --> 00:20:51.833
Triple Thrust!

00:20:51.833 --> 00:20:53.375
Double Slash!

00:20:53.375 --> 00:20:55.041
Tri-Explosion!

00:20:55.041 --> 00:20:56.041
Now!

00:20:57.458 --> 00:20:59.416
Dragon Fang!

00:21:02.583 --> 00:21:05.500
Fran has leveled to Level 8.

00:21:06.666 --> 00:21:09.416
You're steadily leveling up, Fran.

00:21:13.708 --> 00:21:16.083
What? Hang on, this is just too many...

00:21:16.083 --> 00:21:18.708
Don't push yourself too far, Fran.

00:21:18.708 --> 00:21:19.791
Fran!

00:21:25.791 --> 00:21:27.000
Earth Wall!

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:31.458
They're coordinating their attacks!

00:21:31.458 --> 00:21:32.833
Teacher!

00:21:33.791 --> 00:21:35.500
Fire Wall!

00:21:38.541 --> 00:21:41.041
This is too dangerous! Let's retreat for now!

00:21:42.083 --> 00:21:43.708
Let me take a look at your injuries!

00:21:44.791 --> 00:21:48.333
I can handle this level of pain...
I can still fight...

00:21:48.333 --> 00:21:50.583
Fran... why are you so determined?

00:21:50.583 --> 00:21:52.416
I will never...

00:22:01.625 --> 00:22:03.208
back down!

00:23:34.349 --> 00:23:40.083
(Next Episode:
A Goblin Stampede Is an Emergency)
